            <h2>Cathriona Rohan, award winning Hair Stylist</h2>
            Cathriona Rohan began hairdressing in 1989 and has since worked in many prestigious salons. In 2003 she decided to branch out on her own and opened Cathriona’s Hair Salon in Castlegregory, Co.Kerry. Since then she has established a great reputation focusing on a high level of customer care and dedication to excellence. Cathriona takes time to personally get to know each of her customers and specifically tailors to their individual needs.
            Cathriona is also an award winning hair stylist and is recognised as being a top creative talent in the field of celebrity styles as well as luxury hairdressing for catwalks and magazine shoots. Cathriona’s styles have appeared on TV3 Ireland, and both she and her team have styled for a number of high profile fashion shows including:
            Cathriona is also the in-house stylist with The Norma O’Donoghue Model Agency based in Kerry.
        </div>
