            <h2>Cathriona’s Hair Salon – Tralee and Castlegregory</h2>
            Cathriona’s Hair Salon celebrated 10 years in business in 2013, and to mark the momentous occasion, Cathriona revamped the salon in Castlegregory. Completely redesigned it now expertly balances a stylish vintage chic with a warm and welcoming atmosphere, making it a favourite both locally and countrywide.
            Cathriona’s Hair Salon continues to offer a wide variety of treatments including Olaplaex, Kevin Murphy, Alfa Parf, Wella colour and Joico conditioning for hair care treatments. The Salon also specialises in cuts and the very popular Great Lengths Hair Extensions. One of the key successes to Cathriona’s is her in-depth knowledge of the wedding industry, which led to the introduction of a Mobile Hair Service, bringing expertise conveniently to the clients. Her staff specialises in bridal hairstyles, as well as offering a comprehensive range of services for men and women, including free consultations.
            At Cathriona’s Hair Salon we understand the importance of a great cut and colour and how the right hairstyle can make you feel like a million dollars – not only on the inside but on the outside as well.
            In 2015 Cathriona opened up a new ‘state of the art’ salon in Tralee, Co.Kerry to satisfy the demand from customers in that location.
